Philippa Northeast (born 23 September 1994) is an Australian actress, known for her role
as Evelyn MacGuire in the soap opera Home and Away from 2013 until 2017.

11
00:54:21,176 --> 00:54:27,176
After leaving Home and Away, Northeast starred in the 2019 romantic
comedy film Standing Up for Sunny with RJ Mitte.

12
00:59:17,647 --> 00:59:23,647
She also starred in the Hallmark television film A Royal Runaway Romance (2022).

13
01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
In 2023, Northeast played the recurring role of Lily in
the Australian comedy series In Limbo.

14
01:09:10,588 --> 01:09:16,588
She was also cast as Kay Walters in the second season of The Newsreader, and
joined the supporting cast of Network 10 drama Paper Dolls.

15
